! ===========================================================================
! youtube-ads.blocklist
! YouTube advertising and ad-measurement hosts.
!
! Device-agnostic: covers the Google ad stack that YouTube uses, on any
! client that runs YouTube (Tizen TV app, browser, phone, tablet).
!
! Format: Adblock-Plus style, one rule per line.
!   ||domain^      block the domain and every subdomain
!   @@||domain^    never block (KEEP) - these win over block rules
!   /^regex$/      block when the regular expression matches
!
! WHAT THIS DOES AND DOES NOT DO
! A DNS filter sees hostnames only. It can stop the ad host from being
! reached, so the ad request fails and the player moves on. It cannot see the
! ad slots inside the player response, so it cannot remove a pre-roll that
! YouTube decides to serve from its own servers. Expect less ad telemetry
! and fewer ad requests - not necessarily an ad-free screen.
!
! DESIGN RULE: playback first. Every host that carries video, images or the
! app itself is pinned with an explicit KEEP rule, and those KEEP rules win
! over every block rule below. If a block rule ever starts to look like it
! could touch playback, the KEEP rule is the one that has to give.
!
! KNOWN SIDE EFFECTS
!   googleads.g.doubleclick.net  also serves Google Play Store video and
!                                Google Ads campaign traffic. Blocking it
!                                can break Play Store video previews on a
!                                device that uses Google Play.
!   doubleclick.net              also used by Google Ads and AdSense
!                                properties. Harmless on a TV.
! ===========================================================================

! --- Measured: seen in the dnsguard query log, YouTube session on the TV ---
! --- (192.0.2.64, native Tizen YouTube app) ------------------------------
||doubleclick.net^
||googlesyndication.com^

! --- Same Google ad path, not yet observed in the log ---------------------
! --- Ad exchange, ad serving, Google tag/ad services ---------------------
||2mdn.net^
||doubleclick.com^
||googletagservices.com^
||googleadservices.com^
||googleads.com^
||adservice.google^

! --- Ad verification and viewability measurement -------------------------
! --- These are the vendors a smart TV leans on for TV ad measurement -----
||moatads.com^
||innovid.com^
||fwmrm.net^
||adform.net^
||adsafeprotected.com^
||fastclick.net^
||tubemogul.com^
||cc-dt.com^
||flashtalking.com^

! --- KEEP: playback, images and the app itself must survive filtering ----
@@||googlevideo.com^
@@||youtube.com^
@@||ytimg.com^
@@||ggpht.com^
@@||gstatic.com^
